Teacher Dashboard

Log in as a teacher and design a flow where teachers can:

Create assessments based strictly on the template defined by the School Admin.

If the admin defines (e.g., 2 quizzes, 2 tests), that should be the exact structure available to the teacher.

The teacher should be able to:

Enter student grades at any time (no restriction while working).

Publish grades  to students when ready (this will be done after each quiz, test, or assignment).

Once published to students, the grades should become locked (non-editable).

Grading Window (Admin Side)

Review the Grading Window feature under Academic → Grading.

Ensure that this window:

Applies only to the Period Final Grade submission.

Does NOT restrict teachers from entering assessment scores during the term.

The behavior and UI should clearly communicate this distinction.

Overall, I want the design to feel very clear, structured, and aligned with the real workflow used in Liberian schools. Keep the UI clean and practical—no unnecessary complexity.